## SQL Statements

Simplified SQL used by the provider to read this data source.

```sql
-- List the memberships, narrowed by the configured group and user.
SELECT ... FROM pg_group JOIN pg_user ... WHERE ...;
```

## Read Behavior

Items are ordered by group and user. Every user can read `pg_group` and `pg_user`, so every membership is
listed. Filters match names exactly. `id` contains the configured filters within the warehouse.
